Description: Sartoria desktop metapackage
 Keyboard-first herbstluftwm session for Sartoria (Devuan remix).
 Ships session defaults, the sartoria CLI, the XLibre apt source, and
 depends on the Phase B application stack. XLibre itself is a
 Recommends: enable the shipped source, apt-get update, then install
 xlibre. Xorg is a development rescue, not the product session.
 Hybrid NVIDIA is a separate package (sartoria-nvidia).
